Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 bash,
 iproute2,
 iptables,
 nftables,
 procps,
 sudo,
 systemd,
 wireguard-tools
Recommends: bash-completion
Description: command-line manager for WireGuard servers
 gwu initializes and administers a WireGuard server, manages peers,
 manages configuration templates and a shared egress channel through Netlink.
 .
 Installing this package only installs the gwu executable and its runtime
 dependencies. Server configuration is performed explicitly by gwu wireguard init.
